OL,3,AYemenis flee across Red Sea as Houthis
OL,4,Aand Saudi-backed forces escalate war
OL,5,
OL,6,FIbrahim Issa, 50, is from the Yemeni
OL,7,Fcoastal town of Dhubab, right on the
OL,8,Ffront lines of the war between Yemen's
OL,9,FHouthis and the Saudi-backed
OL,10,Fpro-government forces fighting them.
OL,12,FToday he sits, surrounded by his
OL,13,Ffamily, on a tarpaulin spread over a
OL,14,Fsandy floor inside a vast open-sided
OL,15,Fwarehouse at Markazi camp in Obock,
OL,16,Fnorthern Djibouti, packed with Yemeni
OL,17,Ffamilies who have fled by boat across
OL,18,Fthe narrow Bab al-Mandab Strait.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
