OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AYemenis flee across Red Sea as Houthis
OL,4,Aand Saudi-backed forces escalate war
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter their sea crossing, Yemeni
OL,7,Frefugees have made their way by truck
OL,8,Fand on foot to this camp, jointly
OL,9,Fadministered by the government and the
OL,10,FUN.
OL,12,F"How could I just sit there when my
OL,13,Fkids are screaming and shaking in
OL,14,Fterror?" says Ibrahim Issa. "When the
OL,15,Fsound of the planes start, and the kids
OL,16,Fhear the planes, they begin shouting
OL,17,Fand screaming. As parents it is our
OL,18,Fresponsibility, what can you do when
OL,19,Fyou see this? That is why we fled, to
OL,20,Fsave them."
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
