OL,3,AIran must stop arming Houthis in Yemen,
OL,4,AG7 says ahead of UN General Assembly
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of refugees have fled Yemen
OL,7,Fin recent days after the Iran-backed
OL,8,Fgroup seized territory along the
OL,9,Fcountry's Red Sea coastline, including
OL,10,Fnear the Bab al-Mandab Strait, a
OL,11,Fcritical shipping route for global
OL,12,Ftrade.
OL,14,FThe statement comes ahead of the annual
OL,15,FUN General Assembly in New York, where
OL,16,Fsenior Iranian officials are due to
OL,17,Fspeak.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
