OL,3,ACNN, MS NOW and Politico file lawsuit
OL,4,Aagainst Trump's White House ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe White House later launched a
OL,7,Fstreaming channel, Trump TV, after
OL,8,Fmajor US networks suspended their
OL,9,Fpooled coverage of the president ahead
OL,10,Fof the United Nations General Assembly
OL,11,Fin New York.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
